# ai-usagebar-win - files that never enter the repository

# ---- Dependencies and build artefacts ----
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
*.binlog
AppPackages/
BundleArtifacts/
*.appx
*.msix
# Python bytecode from scripts/.
__pycache__/
# Rust output from the original tree, kept until the old tree is fully removed.
/target

# ---- Bundled binaries ----
# The Rust CLI is built by the release workflow and embedded at publish time.
# Regenerable and about 12 MB, so it is never committed.
AiUsageBar/Assets/ai-usagebar.exe

# ---- Environment ----
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ---- Logs ----
*.log

# ---- Generated and regenerable ----
graphify-out/

# ---- Controle de trabalho ----
# Rascunho de trabalho, nao documentacao: muda a cada sessao e cita o que
# ainda esta quebrado.
CHECKLIST.md

# ---- OS and editors ----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
